</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.real[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.imaginary[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.imaginary[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rotatedImag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.real[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.imaginary[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.imaginary[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.real[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diffReal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rotatedReal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.real[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diffImag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rotatedImag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.imaginary[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffReal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffReal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffImag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffImag;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RotatE 将关系建模为复数空间中的旋转操作：t = h ∘ r（Hadamard 积），约束 |r_i| = 1。旋转操作可以同时建模对称、反对称、逆和组合关系，是目前表达能力最强的翻译类模型之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练策略与评估\">训练策略与评估</h2><p>图嵌入的训练核心是负采样策略。均匀随机负采样可能生成「太容易」的负样本（如用无关实体替换），导致模型无法学习细粒度的区分能力。Self-Adversarial Negative Sampling 根据当前模型的评分为负样本分配权重，使更难区分的负样本获得更大的梯度贡献。</p>\n<p>评估图嵌入模型通常使用链接预测任务：对于测试集中的三元组 (h, r, ?)，模型为所有候选尾实体打分并排序，然后计算 MRR（Mean Reciprocal Rank）和 Hits@k（正确实体排在前 k 名的比例）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型值（FB15k-237）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MRR</td>\n<td>正确实体排名倒数的均值</td>\n<td>0.30-0.35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hits@1</td>\n<td>正确实体排第1</td>\n<td>0.20-0.25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hits@3</td>\n<td>正确实体排前3</td>\n<td>0.30-0.38</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hits@10</td>\n<td>正确实体排前10</td>\n<td>0.45-0.55</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图嵌入将实体和关系映射到低维向量空间，是知识图谱推理的基础</li>\n<li>TransE 是最经典的翻译距离模型，简单高效但难处理一对多关系</li>\n<li>DistMult 适合对称关系，ComplEx 通过复数空间解决非对称问题</li>\n<li>RotatE 将关系建模为旋转操作，可同时建模多种关系模式</li>\n<li>负采样策略直接影响模型训练效果，Self-Adversarial 采样表现最优</li>\n<li>链接预测是图嵌入的标准评估任务，MRR 和 Hits@k 是核心指标</li>\n<li>工业场景中图嵌入通常与 GNN 结合使用，充分利用图的结构信息</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../kg-reasoning/kg-embedding\">知识图谱嵌入</a>：TransE/RotatE/ComplEx 等模型族的更细致对比</li>\n<li><a href=\"../kg-reasoning/neural-reasoning\">神经网络推理</a>：图嵌入与 GNN 结合做端到端推理的进阶</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../graph-neural-networks/foundations/message-passing\">消息传递（图神经网络）</a>：GNN 聚合图结构信息的核心机制，是&quot;嵌入+GNN&quot;的另一半</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/embedding-fundamentals/vector-representation\">向量表示（RAG 知识系统）</a>：低维稠密向量的通用基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图嵌入方法","id":"图嵌入方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"翻译距离模型","id":"翻译距离模型"},{"level":2,"text":"语义匹配模型","id":"语义匹配模型"},{"level":2,"text":"训练策略与评估","id":"训练策略与评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"知识融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction/knowledge-fusion"},"next":{"title":"知识图谱嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-embedding"}}